  m_text: 'The Forensics say that the girl died from blunt force trauma.


    Peter
    was seen searching his wedding ring. Couldn''t find it because of his poor eyesight.


    John
    had the hammer while he was burying the dog.


    Jimmy was outside. He sneaked
    out through Peter''s library.


    This happened in the 1st floor of the house.
    While everyone was downstairs.'
