  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Forgotten Runes - A simple book. But it's thick enough to hit someone
    in the head. And the runes..seems a bit familiar.\n\nHammer - The hammer, it
    seems a bit out of the place. Could this be..? Maybe.\n\nCleaver - A cleaver
    with some blood on it. Seems obvious.\n\nTeddy - This belonged to her. And by
    the looks of it, it happened here.\n\nBroken Bottle - Was this used for \nthe
    murder? Or it's just happened to be here?\n\nShattered Glasses - The killer dropped
    these. For sure.\n\nLantern - Maybe he got startled? Maybe that's why he dropped
    it? So someone must've seen something.\n\nShovel - This was definetely there
    when the lantern was dropped.\n\nWedding Ring - So whoever it is, they didn't
    wanna wear it while killing her."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ca8064ef43f268a4eacb42b17b312b2e, type: 2}
